# The Xcode project is tracked so fresh checkouts build without xcodegen.
# Regenerate with `xcodegen generate` only if project.yml changes.
# xcuserdata/xcuserstate stay ignored (per-user).

# Xcode / Swift build artifacts
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
*.xcscmblueprint
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# SPM
.build/
Package.resolved
